## 15. SECURITY AND ABUSE

You may not knowingly use a DPN contribution channel to distribute:

- Malware.
- Credential theft.
- Backdoors.
- Destructive payloads.
- Unauthorized remote-access mechanisms.
- Deliberately concealed malicious behavior.

Normal FiveM administrative functionality is not prohibited merely because it has privileged capabilities; the restriction concerns malicious or deceptive use and distribution.

