Your rights under this license terminate if you materially violate its conditions.

Examples include unauthorized resale, deliberate attribution removal used to conceal origin, or commercial redistribution without permission.

Where appropriate and legally permissible, DPN Technology may allow a violation to be cured.

Termination does not eliminate obligations or liabilities that already arose from conduct occurring before termination.

